{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balltopia</strong> is a roguelike marble racing simulator where your only objective is to make more money. Featuring dozens of unique levels and over 50 game-altering cards, the potential to win is almost limitless - but be careful! Place an errant bet, and you could lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You decide your risk. </strong>Along the way,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you'll discover synergistic card combos and strategies. Some will allow you to play it safe, and others will require you to risk everything - with the potential to win even bigger. Is it worth the gamble?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are you waiting for?</strong> Hop on in and get the ball rolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1757700989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003490?t=1757700989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/9f6a9d58808a2470604c66d46c27cf79cfe61bae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757700989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003490/9f6a9d58808a2470604c66d46c27cf79cfe61bae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757700989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like gambling, right?</strong> Of course you do! As I've always said, there's no better way to invest your money than putting it all on red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph